<title>UK: Ford Motor Credit Corp sets $200 mln three-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Credit Corp sets $200 mln three-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125 PCT MATURITY    03.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.026   PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.876    SPREAD	+23 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND CURRENT THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
